cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DOME in your research, please cite it using this file."
title: "DOME: A Configurable Dataverse MCP Server"
abstract: "DOME is a configurable MCP engine that turns a Dataverse OpenAPI document into MCP tools, making selected parts of the Dataverse API available to AI agents and other MCP clients."
authors:
